  "bodyHtml": "\n\n\t\n\t\t<div class=\"archive-header\">\n\n\t<h1 class=\"archive-title\">Chris Banks</h1>\n\n\t\n\t\n</div>\n\t\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<article class=\"entry author-pwsbuilder has-excerpt post-5640 post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail category-education category-events category-monthly-meetings category-news tag-chris-banks tag-monthly-meetings tag-zoom\" id=\"post-5640\">\n\n\t\n\t\t<a href=\"/news/chris-banks-demonstrates-on-zoom/\"><img class=\"portrait cw-greater thumbnail stargazer-full\" width=\"415\" height=\"500\" alt=\"A painting tools on a table.\" src=\"/media/archive/1937045ed9a9793d38619dd92b860b355c2a6c2f7e857775197efaf934e0b279.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" /></a>\n\t\t<header class=\"entry-header\">\n\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"entry-title\"><a href=\"/news/chris-banks-demonstrates-on-zoom/\" rel=\"bookmark\">Chris Banks Demonstrates on Zoom!</a></h2>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"entry-byline\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-author\"><a href=\"/archive/source-37895d34f8cef391272c/\" rel=\"author\" class=\"url fn n\"><span>pwsbuilder</span></a></span>\n\t\t\t\t<time class=\"entry-published updated\" datetime=\"2021-02-17T18:25:27-05:00\" title=\"Wednesday, February 17, 2021, 6:25 pm\">February 17, 2021</time>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"comments-link\"></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t</header>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-summary\">\n\t\t\t<p>The Guild of Harwich Artists will host Cape Cod artist and former Guild President Chris Banks virtually via Zoom on February 20, 2021, after the members’ meeting at 2:00 p.m. Banks will discuss tips and techniques for painting in oils on a black surface.</p>\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\n</article>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<article class=\"entry author-pwsbuilder post-5588 post type-post status-publish format-standard category-events category-monthly-meetings category-news tag-chris-banks\" id=\"post-5588\">\n\n\t\n\t\t<a href=\"/news/february-zoom-presentation-painting-oils-on-a-black-surface-with-chris-banks/\"><img class=\"portrait cw-greater thumbnail stargazer-full\" width=\"415\" height=\"500\" alt=\"A painting tools on a table.\" src=\"/media/archive/1937045ed9a9793d38619dd92b860b355c2a6c2f7e857775197efaf934e0b279.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" /></a>\n\t\t<header class=\"entry-header\">\n\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"entry-title\"><a href=\"/news/february-zoom-presentation-painting-oils-on-a-black-surface-with-chris-banks/\" rel=\"bookmark\">February Zoom Presentation: Painting Oils on a Black Surface with Chris Banks</a></h2>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"entry-byline\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-author\"><a href=\"/archive/source-37895d34f8cef391272c/\" rel=\"author\" class=\"url fn n\"><span>pwsbuilder</span></a></span>\n\t\t\t\t<time class=\"entry-published updated\" datetime=\"2021-01-26T20:02:15-05:00\" title=\"Tuesday, January 26, 2021, 8:02 pm\">January 26, 2021</time>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"comments-link\"></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t</header>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-summary\">\n\t\t\t<p>The Guild of Harwich Artists will host Cape Cod artist and former Guild President Chris Banks virtually via Zoom on February 20, 2021, after the members’ meeting at 2:00 p.m. <a href=\"/news/february-zoom-presentation-painting-oils-on-a-black-surface-with-chris-banks/\" class=\"more-link\">[…]</a></p>\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\n</article>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<article class=\"entry author-pwsbuilder post-3752 post type-post status-publish format-standard category-artweek category-events category-gallery-artists category-news tag-chris-banks tag-elaine-felos-ostrander tag-harwich-chamber-of-commerce tag-martha-little-fuentes tag-toast-of-harwich tag-wequassett\" id=\"post-3752\">\n\n\t\n\t\t<a href=\"/news/17th-annual-toast-of-harwich/\"><img class=\"landscape cw-greater thumbnail stargazer-full\" width=\"838\" height=\"500\" alt=\"A painting of a group of people dancing.\" src=\"/media/archive/59b43ea8321581b0f324b9fe4ddc1f86e86ddc9a01e1cae6a4b86841c7a75479.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" /></a>\n\t\t<header class=\"entry-header\">\n\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"entry-title\"><a href=\"/news/17th-annual-toast-of-harwich/\" rel=\"bookmark\">17th Annual Toast of Harwich</a></h2>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"entry-byline\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-author\"><a href=\"/archive/source-37895d34f8cef391272c/\" rel=\"author\" class=\"url fn n\"><span>pwsbuilder</span></a></span>\n\t\t\t\t<time class=\"entry-published updated\" datetime=\"2018-04-28T22:23:24-04:00\" title=\"Saturday, April 28, 2018, 10:23 pm\">April 28, 2018</time>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"comments-link\"></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t</header>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-summary\">\n\t\t\t<p>The 17th Annual Toast of Harwich was held Friday, April 27 at the Wequassett Resort &amp; Golf Club. It was a very busy night with music, lots of food and <a href=\"/news/17th-annual-toast-of-harwich/\" class=\"more-link\">[…]</a></p>\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\n</article>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<article class=\"entry author-pwsbuilder post-3684 post type-post status-publish format-standard category-bank-shows category-events category-meet-the-artist category-monthly-meetings category-the-gallery category-news tag-andrew-kusmin tag-artweek tag-chris-banks tag-elaine-felos-ostrander tag-kathleen-magnusson tag-larry-folding tag-lydia-bell tag-martha-little-fuentes tag-the-art-gallery-of-the-guild-of-harwich-artists tag-yvette-stenzel\" id=\"post-3684\">\n\n\t\n\t\t<a href=\"/news/april-guild-news/\"><img class=\"portrait cw-greater thumbnail stargazer-full\" width=\"375\" height=\"500\" alt=\"An older woman painting with watercolors at a table.\" src=\"/media/archive/00421df83ff95b315a4308f2588b50a921d82bd450400bc624f11b2de9128f5b.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" /></a>\n\t\t<header class=\"entry-header\">\n\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"entry-title\"><a href=\"/news/april-guild-news/\" rel=\"bookmark\">April Guild News</a></h2>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"entry-byline\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-author\"><a href=\"/archive/source-37895d34f8cef391272c/\" rel=\"author\" class=\"url fn n\"><span>pwsbuilder</span></a></span>\n\t\t\t\t<time class=\"entry-published updated\" datetime=\"2018-04-03T01:06:43-04:00\" title=\"Tuesday, April 3, 2018, 1:06 am\">April 3, 2018</time>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"comments-link\"></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t</header>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-summary\">\n\t\t\t<p>April Meetings: Executive Board Meeting:  Monday, April 9, 2018, 9:30a.m. at Harwich Chamber of Commerce Board Room, 1 Schoolhouse Road, Harwich Port Gallery Meeting:  Saturday, April 21, 2018, 12:30 p.m <a href=\"/news/april-guild-news/\" class=\"more-link\">[…]</a></p>\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\n</article>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<article class=\"entry author-pwsbuilder post-3339 post type-post status-publish format-standard category-plein-air category-events category-news tag-barbara-quinn-grasso tag-chris-banks tag-dib-carlson tag-elaine-felos-ostrander tag-harwich-conservation-trust tag-john-glass tag-larry-folding tag-maryrose-reynolds tag-peg-masce tag-weedie-tyldesley\" id=\"post-3339\">\n\n\t\n\t\t<a href=\"/news/beautiful-weather-for-the-5th-annual-harwich-conservation-trust-wildlands-music-art-stroll/\"><img class=\"landscape cw-greater thumbnail stargazer-full\" width=\"919\" height=\"500\" alt=\"A man with a easel in front of a tent.\" src=\"/media/archive/f38fa2eb4a26f4ecc8c16a96e7658261dddafe2f7c2b6f8bbf690f92fde1a7ef.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" /></a>\n\t\t<header class=\"entry-header\">\n\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"entry-title\"><a href=\"/news/beautiful-weather-for-the-5th-annual-harwich-conservation-trust-wildlands-music-art-stroll/\" rel=\"bookmark\">Beautiful Weather for the 5th Annual Harwich Conservation Trust Wildlands Music &amp; Art Stroll</a></h2>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"entry-byline\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-author\"><a href=\"/archive/source-37895d34f8cef391272c/\" rel=\"author\" class=\"url fn n\"><span>pwsbuilder</span></a></span>\n\t\t\t\t<time class=\"entry-published updated\" datetime=\"2017-09-14T00:49:35-04:00\" title=\"Thursday, September 14, 2017, 12:49 am\">September 14, 2017</time>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"comments-link\"></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t</header>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-summary\">\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\n</article>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<article class=\"entry author-pwsbuilder post-3039 post type-post status-publish format-standard category-plein-air category-events category-news tag-cape-cod-artist tag-chris-banks tag-harwich-ma tag-larry-folding tag-plein-air tag-saqutucket-harbor\" id=\"post-3039\">\n\n\t\n\t\t<a href=\"/news/saqutucket-harbor-en-plein-air/\"><img class=\"landscape cw-greater thumbnail stargazer-full\" width=\"500\" height=\"500\" alt=\"Chris Banks painting en plein air at Saquatucket Harbor\" src=\"/media/archive/6e7f83af579703b3b8c24dadad99ca6d6c67797a6b8d8263d8b2ff413e7a7941.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" /></a>\n\t\t<header class=\"entry-header\">\n\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"entry-title\"><a href=\"/news/saqutucket-harbor-en-plein-air/\" rel=\"bookmark\">Saquatucket Harbor En Plein Air</a></h2>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"entry-byline\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-author\"><a href=\"/archive/source-37895d34f8cef391272c/\" rel=\"author\" class=\"url fn n\"><span>pwsbuilder</span></a></span>\n\t\t\t\t<time class=\"entry-published updated\" datetime=\"2017-06-29T18:45:22-04:00\" title=\"Thursday, June 29, 2017, 6:45 pm\">June 29, 2017</time>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"comments-link\"></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t</header>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-summary\">\n\t\t\t<p>Members of the Guild of Harwich Artists meet weekly on Wednesday mornings to paint en plein air. Click here for the summer schedule.</p>\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\n</article>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\n\t\n",
